{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33662","headline":"少年行 · 邵谒","name":"少年行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈夫十八九，胆气欺韩彭。\n报雠不用剑，辅国不用兵。\n以目爲水监，以心作权衡。\n愿君似尧舜，能使天下平。\n何必走马夸弓矢，然後致得人心争。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}